WEBVTT

00:00:13.110 --> 00:00:15.240
That's the Queen's castle.

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:16.070
Right.

00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:18.530
That's where Mirim is.

00:02:06.100 --> 00:02:08.140
The Queen's castle is right before us.

00:02:08.140 --> 00:02:10.560
The interior is heavily guarded.

00:02:11.150 --> 00:02:14.360
First, we need to figure out a way to get inside

00:02:14.360 --> 00:02:16.150
without being detected by the soldiers.

00:02:16.650 --> 00:02:19.030
This isn't Shai-Fang food!

00:02:19.410 --> 00:02:21.620
How is this authentic?

00:02:21.620 --> 00:02:23.030
It's not even close.

00:02:23.280 --> 00:02:24.990
Let's see here.

00:02:24.990 --> 00:02:26.830
You ordered the Shai-Fang rice and soup dumplings,

00:02:26.830 --> 00:02:29.460
as well as our restaurant's excellent Shai-Fang duck.

00:02:29.960 --> 00:02:32.420
Did it not suit your taste?

00:02:32.420 --> 00:02:35.880
How do you expect fake Shai-Fang food to suit my tastes?!

00:02:35.880 --> 00:02:38.550
F-Fake? That's a bit much...

00:02:38.550 --> 00:02:41.220
We use fresh ingredients and spices

00:02:41.220 --> 00:02:43.390
directly from the famed Shai-Fang Harbour,

00:02:43.390 --> 00:02:45.350
and have an authentic top chef

00:02:45.350 --> 00:02:46.930
that brings the food to authentic perfection!

00:02:46.930 --> 00:02:48.480
Harbour...

00:02:48.480 --> 00:02:50.310
I thought Shai-Fang was a place deep

00:02:50.310 --> 00:02:51.980
in the mountains yet to be explored by civilization.

00:02:51.980 --> 00:02:52.860
Huh?

00:02:52.860 --> 00:02:55.980
B-But for having not liked the food,

00:02:55.980 --> 00:02:58.780
you seem to have eaten quite a lot!

00:02:59.820 --> 00:03:02.780
I told you you were eating too much, Tarnyang.

00:03:03.490 --> 00:03:05.200
Anyway, I don't think we can—

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:09.540
You're not going to say you can't pay, are you?

00:03:12.960 --> 00:03:14.170
Huh? What's going on?

00:03:14.170 --> 00:03:15.550
Sounds like a dine and dash.

00:03:17.090 --> 00:03:18.420
Onii-chan!

00:03:18.420 --> 00:03:19.130
Yuit?

00:03:19.130 --> 00:03:20.590
Let's get out of here!

00:03:20.590 --> 00:03:22.590
We won't be able to save Mirim

00:03:22.590 --> 00:03:24.550
if we get caught up in the commotion here.

00:03:25.050 --> 00:03:26.510
B-But...

00:03:29.890 --> 00:03:31.890
You want to fight us?

00:03:31.890 --> 00:03:35.900
But, Tarnyang, aren't there a few too many of them?

00:03:36.440 --> 00:03:38.780
Why are you acting so scared, Sainyang?

00:03:38.780 --> 00:03:40.780
This'll be perfect to work off the food we just ate.

00:03:42.490 --> 00:03:43.740
Let's go.

00:03:45.200 --> 00:03:46.240
Stupid girl.

00:03:56.290 --> 00:03:58.340
Now come on!

00:03:58.340 --> 00:04:00.590
Teach them a lesson and then sell them off!

00:04:13.480 --> 00:04:15.400
Look at these ingredients!

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:17.440
They're all low-quality goods you could find anywhere!

00:04:17.440 --> 00:04:19.530
This fish is starting to go bad!

00:04:19.530 --> 00:04:21.570
These are all local vegetables!

00:04:21.570 --> 00:04:23.610
How can you call this authentic Shai-Fang cuisine?!

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:28.990
With all this noise, the soldiers might be on their way.

00:04:29.240 --> 00:04:32.910
We need to hurry up and figure out a way to sneak into the castle.

00:04:32.910 --> 00:04:33.920
Ah ha!

00:04:34.370 --> 00:04:36.330
I thought you guys were suspicious,

00:04:36.330 --> 00:04:37.920
but now I see what's going on.

00:04:42.590 --> 00:04:44.260
You're the ones from the restaurant...

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:45.970
The dine and dash sisters.

00:04:46.470 --> 00:04:48.350
Who are you calling the "dine and dash sisters?"

00:04:48.350 --> 00:04:49.720
But she's right...

00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:51.220
What do you want?

00:04:52.520 --> 00:04:54.600
I'm saying this for your own good.

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:57.810
Give up on trying to sneak into the Queen's castle.

00:04:58.610 --> 00:05:00.480
Sneaking into the castle?

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:01.940
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:05:02.190 --> 00:05:03.530
I heard everything.

00:05:03.530 --> 00:05:05.320
Mind your own business!

00:05:05.320 --> 00:05:08.410
Besides, you're the last person I want to hear that from!

00:05:09.160 --> 00:05:12.500
W-Well, you did help us out.

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:14.580
So I just wanted to let you know, as a friend.

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:16.210
Thank you.

00:05:16.210 --> 00:05:18.540
Huh? Uh, you're welcome.

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:24.090
We appreciate the warning, but we must head to the castle, regardless.

00:05:24.380 --> 00:05:26.470
We need to retrieve something that was taken from us.

00:05:36.520 --> 00:05:38.480
This is an entrance to the castle?

00:05:38.940 --> 00:05:40.770
Looks like it's a service gate

00:05:40.770 --> 00:05:42.860
that they used for transporting goods.

00:05:42.860 --> 00:05:45.190
This is as far as we can take you.

00:05:45.570 --> 00:05:47.820
Thank you, Tarnyang and Sainyang.

00:05:47.820 --> 00:05:49.120
You've done plenty.

00:05:50.320 --> 00:05:51.580
Wait a second.

00:06:06.590 --> 00:06:07.720
What was that?

00:06:07.720 --> 00:06:08.840
A ward.

00:06:08.840 --> 00:06:10.510
It'll keep you guys safe.

00:06:10.760 --> 00:06:12.180
Huh.

00:06:12.680 --> 00:06:13.510
Thanks.

00:06:37.250 --> 00:06:38.210
I-I did it!

00:06:38.210 --> 00:06:40.170
I did it, Ymir-sama!

00:06:40.170 --> 00:06:44.340
Looks like you've started to get the hang of the hyper-vibration armour.

00:06:44.590 --> 00:06:45.590
I have!

00:07:06.860 --> 00:07:09.570
Here's the map of the castle that Tarnyang gave us.

00:07:09.570 --> 00:07:12.740
It looks like we're around here right now.

00:07:29.170 --> 00:07:30.380
This is...

00:07:43.810 --> 00:07:46.400
Why is there a colosseum under the castle?

00:07:46.400 --> 00:07:47.480
We don't have time for this.

00:07:47.480 --> 00:07:49.190
Finding Ymir is more important.

00:07:52.320 --> 00:07:53.950
Man, that was a bust.

00:07:55.120 --> 00:07:55.950
Thanks.

00:07:55.950 --> 00:07:57.580
I'll make it back next time.

00:07:57.580 --> 00:07:59.750
And, thank you.

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:02.080
I barely made anything.

00:08:02.460 --> 00:08:03.250
Huh?

00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:07.460
Hey, wasn't that...

00:08:11.300 --> 00:08:13.630
If she's a strategist for the Queen,

00:08:13.630 --> 00:08:15.300
I imagine she'd be higher up in the castle.

00:08:15.760 --> 00:08:18.930
No, if we take into account the fact

00:08:18.930 --> 00:08:22.270
that the Iron Strategist, Ymir, is researching wizard stones,

00:08:22.270 --> 00:08:24.350
from a mineralogical standpoint,

00:08:24.350 --> 00:08:27.400
it would be logical to have a lab underground.

00:08:27.520 --> 00:08:29.070
Uh, I see...

00:08:30.780 --> 00:08:34.280
You want to know where Iron Strategist, Ymir, is?

00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:36.910
I'll tell you.

00:08:36.910 --> 00:08:39.240
Who's this bandaged dude?

00:08:39.240 --> 00:08:40.580
Wait, you're...

00:08:48.590 --> 00:08:50.710
That was quite the spectacle.

00:08:50.710 --> 00:08:52.920
You're pretty strong, and cute to boot.

00:08:52.920 --> 00:08:53.880
That's who you are.

00:08:55.180 --> 00:08:56.550
Thanks for that.

00:08:56.930 --> 00:08:59.970
You know where we can find the Iron Strategist?

00:08:59.970 --> 00:09:02.980
I know everything about this castle.

00:09:02.980 --> 00:09:05.980
But in exchange, you think I could ask you

00:09:05.980 --> 00:09:08.150
for a little something in return?

00:09:08.810 --> 00:09:09.860
In return?

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:23.290
Found you, Nee-sama.

00:09:23.660 --> 00:09:25.920
She still has the smell of that meddling girl on her,

00:09:25.920 --> 00:09:28.580
but it looks like she went through here.

00:09:37.590 --> 00:09:40.640
Why is Onii-chan in a prize fight?

00:09:41.850 --> 00:09:43.520
It's too late for second thoughts.

00:09:43.520 --> 00:09:45.230
Besides, we're going 50/50 on the winnings,

00:09:45.230 --> 00:09:51.070
and even if she loses I'll tell you where your Iron Strategist, Ymir, is.

00:09:51.400 --> 00:09:52.690
But...

00:09:53.150 --> 00:09:54.740
I'm going to win...

00:09:54.740 --> 00:09:57.150
And then I'm going to save Mirim.

00:10:05.540 --> 00:10:06.830
Yes! She's back!

00:10:06.830 --> 00:10:08.370
The Dragon Warrior, Branwen!

00:10:08.870 --> 00:10:11.630
The Dragon Warrior, Branwen...

00:10:19.640 --> 00:10:21.350
Who's she?

00:10:22.300 --> 00:10:23.350
Oh, her?

00:10:23.350 --> 00:10:27.480
She's the mighty imprisoned Dragon Warrior, Branwen.

00:10:28.390 --> 00:10:33.270
There was once a clan that served the ancient dragons.

00:10:33.940 --> 00:10:36.650
They were considered the most rare and noble beings

00:10:36.650 --> 00:10:40.200
on the continent, as the blood of the dragons flowed through their veins.

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:43.280
I don't know what happened,

00:10:43.280 --> 00:10:49.290
but now she's the slave of that asshole goblin over there.

00:10:54.550 --> 00:10:58.170
I have nothing against you, but let us begin.

00:10:58.550 --> 00:11:00.260
What a powerful fighting spirit...

00:11:00.260 --> 00:11:02.640
However, I can't lose!

00:11:21.410 --> 00:11:22.240
Onii-chan!

00:11:23.910 --> 00:11:25.780
What are you doing?!

00:11:25.990 --> 00:11:28.700
No one's going to be happy if you kill her right away!

00:11:28.700 --> 00:11:31.620
That is not the reason I fight!

00:11:32.750 --> 00:11:36.920
Talking back to me, eh?

00:11:36.920 --> 00:11:39.090
I think you want to be punished.

00:11:48.180 --> 00:11:50.060
Not enough?

00:11:50.060 --> 00:11:51.940
How about this, then?!

00:11:54.520 --> 00:11:56.400
Take that!

00:12:01.400 --> 00:12:02.610
W-What's going on?

00:12:03.070 --> 00:12:05.570
How long do you plan on enjoying yourself?!

00:12:05.570 --> 00:12:06.580
Fight!

00:12:12.210 --> 00:12:15.290
Keep it up. Here's a reward!

00:12:17.920 --> 00:12:19.760
Th-There's no doubt about it.

00:12:19.760 --> 00:12:22.130
She's a complete masochist.

00:12:22.130 --> 00:12:23.300
She's a masochist, but...

00:12:28.220 --> 00:12:30.020
What a powerful gaze...

00:12:31.680 --> 00:12:33.060
What is it, Vante?

00:12:33.060 --> 00:12:34.140
What's the matter?

00:12:34.940 --> 00:12:36.860
Huh? Where's that bandaged dude?

00:12:38.570 --> 00:12:39.690
Don't tell me...

00:12:41.570 --> 00:12:45.240
There's no way I know where the Iron Strategist is.

00:12:45.240 --> 00:12:48.490
What about the Iron Strategist?

00:13:05.930 --> 00:13:07.590
She's incredibly strong.

00:13:07.590 --> 00:13:09.350
Onii-chan this is bad!

00:13:09.350 --> 00:13:10.010
Yuit!

00:13:10.010 --> 00:13:11.680
The dude ran off!

00:13:11.680 --> 00:13:14.020
He said he knew where the Iron Strategist was,

00:13:14.020 --> 00:13:16.020
but he was full of it!

00:13:16.690 --> 00:13:17.810
That's...

00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:40.420
Why do you fight so hard?

00:13:42.920 --> 00:13:45.170
To save my companion's friend,

00:13:45.170 --> 00:13:47.050
who was captured by the Iron Strategist!

00:13:47.630 --> 00:13:52.510
And that's why you put your life on the line to sneak in to the Queen's Castle?

00:13:52.890 --> 00:13:55.390
It's true that I didn't put much thought into it.

00:13:55.390 --> 00:13:58.230
But because it's something I can do...

00:14:00.060 --> 00:14:01.900
I will not hesitate!

00:14:08.490 --> 00:14:10.530
I shall respond to that pride of yours.

00:14:39.230 --> 00:14:42.150
That's Sainyang's ward!

00:14:53.490 --> 00:14:54.740
What's going on?!

00:15:01.830 --> 00:15:06.800
Head to the middle level of the castle and find the Sky Garden that was just built.

00:15:08.260 --> 00:15:12.180
Someone said they saw the Iron Strategist, Ymir, there.

00:15:12.720 --> 00:15:13.970
Branwen-dono...

00:15:14.600 --> 00:15:18.850
It seems you have some quality that attracts people.

00:15:19.430 --> 00:15:21.480
Go forth, Princess-Knight.

00:15:21.480 --> 00:15:22.810
Your friends are waiting for you.

00:15:23.230 --> 00:15:26.190
Thank you, Branwen-dono.

00:15:39.500 --> 00:15:42.290
So this is the Sky Garden.

00:15:49.380 --> 00:15:52.430
They built this garden rather fast...

00:15:52.430 --> 00:15:54.720
I'm not sure I like it, though.

00:15:54.720 --> 00:15:57.060
It just doesn't feel very tasteful...

00:15:57.060 --> 00:15:57.890
Ymir!

00:15:59.310 --> 00:16:00.680
I'm not sure who you are,

00:16:00.680 --> 00:16:03.020
but it seems I've become quite famous!

00:16:03.400 --> 00:16:05.560
We've come to take Mirim!

00:16:05.560 --> 00:16:06.480
That's right!

00:16:06.480 --> 00:16:07.820
Give Mirim back!

00:16:07.820 --> 00:16:09.190
Where is she?!

00:16:09.190 --> 00:16:10.690
Mirim?

00:16:10.690 --> 00:16:12.700
My, what are you talking about?

00:16:12.700 --> 00:16:13.700
Shut up!

00:16:13.990 --> 00:16:15.370
There's no point in playing dumb.

00:16:16.780 --> 00:16:19.830
Like I said, who's Mirim?

00:16:19.830 --> 00:16:22.790
I haven't been able to follow what you're saying at all.

00:16:22.790 --> 00:16:24.710
You look like warriors.

00:16:24.710 --> 00:16:27.540
Are you interested in any of the weapons I'm developing?

00:16:27.540 --> 00:16:29.340
I can get you a good deal!

00:16:29.340 --> 00:16:30.550
Stop acting like you don't know anything!

00:16:31.720 --> 00:16:33.930
Seize the intruders!

00:16:33.930 --> 00:16:35.050
There they are!

00:16:35.890 --> 00:16:38.220
Huh? When did they find us?

00:16:39.970 --> 00:16:44.310
Onii-chan, let's forget about her and find Mirim!

00:16:44.310 --> 00:16:46.650
She should be around here somewhere!

00:16:47.110 --> 00:16:47.730
Right.

00:16:48.020 --> 00:16:50.360
That person you're looking for...

00:16:50.360 --> 00:16:52.280
I hope you can get her back safely.

00:16:53.150 --> 00:16:55.110
Oh, we'll get her back safe and sound.

00:16:55.110 --> 00:16:56.740
I don't care what you say!

00:16:57.160 --> 00:16:59.370
You know, there are times

00:16:59.370 --> 00:17:02.750
you can't take things back by force, though.

00:17:03.040 --> 00:17:05.120
What do you mean by that?

00:17:05.120 --> 00:17:06.120
What do you know?

00:17:06.380 --> 00:17:09.540
No, nothing... I just have a feeling, you know?

00:17:11.460 --> 00:17:13.220
Onii-chan, hurry!

00:17:13.220 --> 00:17:14.130
Right.

00:17:28.270 --> 00:17:30.770
Nee-nee, I've finally found you!

00:17:33.030 --> 00:17:34.570
You're that girl who...

00:17:34.570 --> 00:17:36.150
Lunaluna, why are you here?

00:17:36.660 --> 00:17:39.410
I was searching for you, Nee-nee,

00:17:39.410 --> 00:17:41.490
and came to this castle, but...

00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:42.660
Over here! Hurry!

00:17:42.660 --> 00:17:44.330
Don't tell me...

00:17:45.750 --> 00:17:47.250
I guess they found me.

00:17:48.830 --> 00:17:50.290
There's nothing we can do about it now.

00:17:50.290 --> 00:17:52.340
Let's leave the castle for now.

00:17:52.340 --> 00:17:54.300
She's got accomplices!

00:18:03.720 --> 00:18:06.560
I command thee in the name of thy master, Yuit!

00:18:06.560 --> 00:18:08.310
Destroy the enemies!

00:18:34.760 --> 00:18:36.210
Th-This is bad!

00:18:36.210 --> 00:18:37.800
Hey! Lower the castle gate!

00:18:37.800 --> 00:18:39.010
R-Right!

00:18:43.010 --> 00:18:43.850
Vante!

00:18:51.940 --> 00:18:53.020
That voice...

00:19:06.500 --> 00:19:07.790
Yuit-chan?!

00:19:10.580 --> 00:19:11.880
Mirim!

00:19:14.170 --> 00:19:15.750
Mirim, let's go home together!

00:19:17.960 --> 00:19:19.880
Mirim, hurry up and come with us!

00:19:23.140 --> 00:19:24.220
This is bad!

00:19:25.560 --> 00:19:27.100
What are you doing, Mirim?!

00:19:27.100 --> 00:19:27.850
Hurry up!

00:19:53.250 --> 00:19:56.380
Mirim... Why?

00:20:18.730 --> 00:20:21.650
Nee-nee, I'm hungry.

00:20:21.650 --> 00:20:23.530
Let's get something to eat.

00:20:23.530 --> 00:20:26.490
I want to get some Shai-Fang food!

00:20:28.990 --> 00:20:30.540
I'm sorry, Yuit.

00:20:31.200 --> 00:20:35.080
I said I'd do whatever I could, but...

00:20:36.790 --> 00:20:38.460
It's not your fault, Onii-chan.

00:20:38.960 --> 00:20:39.920
But...

00:20:40.380 --> 00:20:41.970
I might be imagining it,

00:20:41.970 --> 00:20:44.470
but it was almost like Mirim was staying

00:20:44.470 --> 00:20:45.800
of her own free will.

00:20:46.390 --> 00:20:47.510
I wonder why...

00:21:04.860 --> 00:21:09.200
I spotted those fugitives inside the castle today.

00:21:11.290 --> 00:21:16.580
They stormed the castle with only three members... No, four.

00:21:17.170 --> 00:21:20.920
It was quite foolish to enter the castle with such little manpower.

00:21:21.800 --> 00:21:22.630
However...

00:21:23.090 --> 00:21:25.380
The Alchemy Steel Woman, Vante...

00:21:25.380 --> 00:21:28.510
She's rather adept.

00:23:11.200 --> 00:23:14.200
Annelotte sneaked into the Queen's Castle

00:23:14.200 --> 00:23:16.700
only to save a friend.

00:23:17.000 --> 00:23:18.620
I had nothing against her,

00:23:18.620 --> 00:23:20.870
but the dragon within my heart began to awaken

00:23:20.870 --> 00:23:23.790
when I fought her in the underground arena.

00:23:24.250 --> 00:23:27.630
I decided to call that courageous knight, "Ane-sama."

00:23:28.210 --> 00:23:31.180
Next time: "A Crown of Flowers and the Hidden Power."

00:23:31.180 --> 00:23:32.640
The strongest warrior,

00:23:32.640 --> 00:23:35.180
Mirim, created by the Iron Strategist...

00:23:35.180 --> 00:23:40.060
Does your armour not bind your heart, as well?
